# Gemma 4 26B-A4B instruct (MoE: 128 experts, 8 routed + 1 shared dense MLP; 3.8B of 25.2B active),
# cyankiwi's INT4 build of Google's quantization-aware-trained checkpoint
# (cyankiwi/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it-qat-AWQ-INT4 from google/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it-qat-q4_0-unquantized;
# compressed-tensors W4A16, symmetric, group 32; Apache-2.0). Google publishes no W4A16 build of
# this model (only GGUF and the 16-bit QAT checkpoint, 48 GiB). The attention projections and the
# routed experts are 4-bit (Marlin, MarlinExperts); the dense MLP, the router, the tied
# embeddings/lm_head and the vision tower stay 16-bit. The config declares float16; the preset
# serves bf16 activations. Heterogeneous head sizes (256 sliding, 512 global) force Triton attention.
# Its chat template is an older revision of Google's (before the 2026-07-09 tool-calling fixes);
# the differences are outside the chat and prefill path. As on Gemma 4 12B: thinking only when asked
# (off here), no system turn injected, and the generation prompt opens the model turn with an empty
# thought channel, so the prefill reads `<|turn>model\n<|channel>thought\n<channel|>Answer:` (the
# adapter renders the generation prompt; a continued assistant message would lack the channel).
# Measured on an RTX 3090: 15.56 GiB weights (all on the GPU, no CPU offload), 3.98 GiB KV cache
# (43,697 tokens, 5.33 requests of 8,192; at most 55% in use at 16 in flight), 98-104 s to healthy
# (~35 s of it torch.compile), 20.2 GiB in use (nvidia-smi).
# As gemma-4-12b-int4: --language-model-only skips the vision tower; --max-num-batched-tokens=1024
# and --max-num-seqs=16 as in the other presets; --generation-config=vllm ignores the upload's
# sampling defaults; 0.90 of the GPU.
JEVEMU_VLLM_MODEL=cyankiwi/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it-qat-AWQ-INT4
JEVEMU_VLLM_MODEL_REVISION=18a3c7285c33ee39d3e5e16ee6fb2c18f4955ef9
JEVEMU_VLLM_DTYPE=bfloat16
JEVEMU_VLLM_MAX_MODEL_LEN=8192
JEVEMU_VLLM_GPU_MEMORY_UTILIZATION=0.90
JEVEMU_VLLM_DEFAULT_CHAT_TEMPLATE_KWARGS='{"enable_thinking":false}'
JEVEMU_VLLM_EXTRA_ARGS='--language-model-only --max-num-seqs=16 --max-num-batched-tokens=1024 --generation-config=vllm'
